This licence is intended to permit public research, education, learning, experimentation, review, interoperability work, and non-commercial development while preserving the copyright, attribution, provenance, and historical legacy of the original SWI work.

The availability of SWI under this licence does not constitute a transfer of ownership.

The copyright holder retains ownership of the original copyrighted materials covered by this licence.

