Any permitted copy, fork, modification, derivative work, or redistribution of covered SWI materials must retain reasonable attribution to the original SWI work.

At minimum, the following notice must remain where technically and reasonably practicable:

Structured Workflow Intelligence (SWI)
Original work by Keletso Ronald Mosidila / Trusts Motion
Copyright © 2026 Keletso Ronald Mosidila / Trusts Motion
Licensed under the SWI Community & Legacy Licence.

Where a modified version is distributed, it must also clearly identify that modifications have been made.

A modified or derivative implementation must not represent itself as the unchanged original SWI repository.

